OL,3,GNEWSACampers urged not to feed horses
OL,4,Adangerous foods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA horse nearly died after being fed
OL,7,Fdangerous foods by campers near a farm,
OL,8,Fprompting a warning from the animal's
OL,9,Fowner.
OL,11,FJulie Kershaw said people had been
OL,12,Fthrowing unsuitable food into her field
OL,13,Fon Syke Moors in Rochdale over the
OL,14,Fsummer, including chicken bones, red
OL,15,Fonions, and lemons.
OL,17,FShe is now warning people about the
OL,18,Fdangers after her horse, Frank,
OL,19,Fcollapsed.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
