OL,3,GNEWSACampers urged not to feed horses
OL,4,Adangerous foods
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Just please don't do it because you're
OL,7,Fcausing a lot of distress to the owners
OL,8,Fand the animals, and it's a lot of
OL,9,Fmoney ` and if you can't get them
OL,10,Fright, then you've lost your pet,"
OL,11,FJulie said.
